@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:又过了几天。<br>晚餐后，少女们受艾玛召集，<br>在会客厅会合。|#0102Adv14_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可现场不见亚里沙的影子。|#0102Adv14_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆あくび混じり

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:呼啊～，好困……没劲……|#0102Adv14_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:一进会客厅可可就倒在了沙发上。<br>梅露露走到她身边问道。|#0102Adv14_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可、可可小姐，你最近是不是昼夜颠倒了？<br>你的脸色看上去不太好……|#0102Adv14_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要不要帮你泡一杯<br>助眠的香草茶……？|#0102Adv14_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:啊？你在监视我吗？<br>跟你有什么关系？|#0102Adv14_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想几点睡就几点睡，想几点起就几点起，<br>又没影响到其他人。|#0102Adv14_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜、呜呜……可是，我很担心你……|#0102Adv14_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露打出了关心牌，但可可明显没当一回事，<br>于是米莉亚也插嘴说道。|#0102Adv14_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:小可，早起心情会更好哦。<br>手机里面也有闹钟功能呢。|#0102Adv14_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚拿出手机，<br>开始操作起来。|#0102Adv14_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; スマホの着信音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_3_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你看，还可以把铃声改成音乐哦！<br>听到喜欢的音乐就能开开心心地起床啦。<br>怎么样！？|#0102Adv14_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔……你真的叔味很重欸。<br>这种事谁都知道啦。|#0102Adv14_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且把手机铃声改成音乐的想法也超像大叔的。|#0102Adv14_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm BgmPath:Ambi_3_1
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管可可嘴上非常嫌弃，但她对米莉亚的态度已经算温柔了。<br>两个人操作着手机，看起来聊得很开心的样子。|#0102Adv14_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛站在会客厅中央，<br>望着这和睦的场面。|#0102Adv14_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她清了清嗓子，一脸紧张地开口道。|#0102Adv14_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:在大家的协助下，<br>明天我们终于要正式执行计划了。|#0102Adv14_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真的非常感谢大家……！|#0102Adv14_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是因为看到了越狱的曙光，<br>在场所有少女脸上的表情都很灿烂。|#0102Adv14_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们是明天下午5点在围墙前执行计划，没错吧。|#0102Adv14_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是的。看守在晚餐时间不会四处巡逻，<br>要动手只能趁这个时候。|#0102Adv14_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:“那东西”的成品已经藏起来了。<br>我敢保证绝对不会被发现。|#0102Adv14_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我可是努力了好一番呢～！<br>只管相信我就好！|#0102Adv14_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:『担心』|#0102Adv14_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有、有、有点担心……|#0102Adv14_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:不要用那种眼神看我呀！？<br>这可是关系到我的信用，我肯定不会敷衍啦。|#0102Adv14_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是出了什么事大叔我负责！|#0102Adv14_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（热气球的成品<br>　由米莉亚负责藏起来）|#0102Adv14_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（目前，<br>　知道热气球藏在哪里的只有米莉亚一个人）|#0102Adv14_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（毕竟米莉亚或许暗中有什么企图，也有可能是幕后黑手，<br>　我也犹豫过，到底该不该相信她……）|#0102Adv14_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但随着越狱计划的推进，<br>大家和米莉亚渐渐变得亲近。|#0102Adv14_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如今，她反而收获了大家的喜爱，<br>就好像团宠一样。|#0102Adv14_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（米莉亚是我们的伙伴，一定不会有问题）|#0102Adv14_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:不好意思，我可以提一个问题吗？|#0102Adv14_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我们的热气球做得不是很大，<br>没法一次载我们所有人走。这点该怎么解决？|#0102Adv14_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，关于这个问题，<br>玛格和我商量过……|#0102Adv14_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:明天的行程，我打算让<br>艾玛和亚里沙两个人先去。|#0102Adv14_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但话说回来，亚里沙现在不在这里，<br>明天能不能出发还不好说。|#0102Adv14_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到玛格的发言，可可一下子着急了起来。|#0102Adv14_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:哈！？给我等下，<br>凭什么就艾玛亲和太妹两个人去！？|#0102Adv14_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不能接受，人家也要去！<br>得赶紧离开这鬼地方……|#0102Adv14_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:之所以让我们先去，<br>是因为人少一点不容易被发现。|#0102Adv14_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，我们还不知道围墙外的情况……<br>所以我们打算确定能出得去以后就回来。|#0102Adv14_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:……什么嘛，是这样啊。好吧。|#0102Adv14_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可像是暂时接受了这个理由，<br>但她看起来仍心存疑虑。|#0102Adv14_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，你们该不会打算<br>自己偷偷溜走吧？|#0102Adv14_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是能飞出围墙的话，<br>你们又没有必要回来帮我们。|#0102Adv14_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:带我一起坐嘛。<br>加一个人又没什么，求你啦～|#0102Adv14_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算你说一定会回来，<br>我也还是没办法相信你。|#0102Adv14_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆カッとして言葉に詰まる

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Adv14_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:而且那个太妹<br>绝对会偷偷溜走。|#0102Adv14_Coco013| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:——我才不会。|#0102Adv14_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙！！|#0102Adv14_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不知何时，亚里沙来到了会客厅。<br>所有人的目光齐刷刷地集中在她身上。|#0102Adv14_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:我会帮你们。|#0102Adv14_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我承诺的事情<br>一定会负责到底，决不放弃。|#0102Adv14_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这下你可没怨言了吧，喂。<br>再啰啰嗦嗦的小心我烧你啊？|#0102Adv14_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:……哼，<br>那我没话好说了行吧？|#0102Adv14_Coco014| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在亚里沙的威吓下，可可终于让步了。<br>然后她转头不停地敲打身边的米莉亚。|#0102Adv14_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～讨厌～那家伙搞什么嘛，吓死人了。|#0102Adv14_Coco015| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:痛、好痛……不要把气撒在大叔我身上呀……|#0102Adv14_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛激动万分地<br>跑到亚里沙身旁。|#0102Adv14_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙，谢谢你愿意过来……<br>我真的好开心。|#0102Adv14_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真是的，谁叫你那么烦人。|#0102Adv14_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我会帮忙让所有人都离开这里，<br>这样就可以了吧？|#0102Adv14_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，嗯……|#0102Adv14_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛高兴得热泪盈眶。<br>这时玛格送来了掌声。|#0102Adv14_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:都是艾玛你的功劳。<br>因为有你的领导，<br>大家才能团结一心。|#0102Adv14_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊！哎呀～真期待明天！<br>祝艾玛和亚里沙幸福美满大结局～|#0102Adv14_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你给我闭嘴。|#0102Adv14_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么就对我那么凶啦～<br>人家还想和你搞好关系耶。|#0102Adv14_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:你太虚伪了，橘。<br>樱羽就很真诚，你们根本不一样。|#0102Adv14_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:所有幸存的少女此刻团结在一起。<br>她们的脸上都绽放出了笑容。|#0102Adv14_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我们才不是魔女，我们大家都是好孩子。<br>　我一定要带大家离开这里……！）|#0102Adv14_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛把手放在胸口，再次下定决心。|#0102Adv14_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

